For those of you who have been asking me about mac nethack: I'm very
sorry about the trashy distribution and my delay in putting up a clean
one.  I would have done it sooner, but I spent most of yesterday
adding code so that it would run on small (SE, Plus) screens and
fixing one last weird bug with creating morgues...  This time it's for
real.  No really. I retransfered the distribution back to my mac, just
in case, and tested it out.  So: /u/ftp/pub/macnh/macnh.sit.Hqx on
whitechapel.media.mit.edu (18.85.0.125) is binhex 4'ed and stuffited
(old version; no hierarchical format).  You will probably want to make
a folder called "lib" and put all of the auxiliary files in it.  If
you can't do ftp let me know and I will mail a split-up version as
soon as I can.

-MS


